{
 "language_code": "eng",
 "language_probability": 0.9705281257629395,
 "text": "One developer created Fumadocs, a docs framework with over thirteen thousand stars on GitHub. Vercel Turborepo, ShadCNUI, BetterAuth, Unkey, and many others use it. Fuma Nama has built it for three years on top of his schoolwork. He learned to code by modding games and reading piles of JavaScript. He did not look at any documentation while he was learning. He designed Fumadocs in four layers that developers can take apart and reshape. The CLI can copy just the table of contents into your codebase. If he started again from scratch, he thinks Fumadocs would probably have the same shape. Fumadocs is General Translation's first open source grantee. [outro jingle]",
